### 594-category-delete-with-children-rejected.http — issue #594
### CASE-07. (Category) 하위 카테고리가 있는 카테고리는 삭제가 거부된다

### 1. 관리자 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@earlybird.co.kr",
  "password": "rawPassword3!"
}

> {%
    client.test("관리자 로그인 성공", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
    client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 2. 카테고리 A 등록
< {% client.global.set("catAName", "usecase594-A-" + Date.now()); %}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "{{catAName}}" }

> {%
    client.test("A 등록 성공", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
    client.global.set("categoryAId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. 카테고리 B 등록 (parent = A)
< {% client.global.set("catBName", "usecase594-B-" + Date.now()); %}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "{{catBName}}", "parentProjectCategoryId": {{categoryAId}} }

> {%
    client.test("B 등록 성공", function () { client.assert(response.status === 200, response.body); });
%}

### 4. 하위 카테고리(B)가 있는 A 삭제 시도 -> 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/project-categories/{{categoryAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("하위 카테고리 존재 -> 삭제 거부(409)", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 409, "expected 409, got " + response.status + ": " + response.body);
    });
%}
